# The first gameplay tutorial asks for a bile flask (Triangle), opens a help page
# that closes with Circle, then requires Triangle once more to consume the flask.
# Repeat short close/action taps with neutral gaps because full-resolution rendering can
# make the overlay become ready while an earlier button is already held. The later edge
# still closes it, while extra face-button taps are harmless after the tutorial advances.
